Package: paradoxR
Title: Mods for Existing R Tools
Version: 26.11.0
Authors@R: 
    person("catch-26", email = "59668327+catch-26@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Mods existing R tools so a specific job takes one call instead
    of a page of glue code. Each mod is either a drop-in replacement with the
    same call shape as the tool it replaces, or a thin wrapper that returns
    one specific plot. The first mod is a brand colour palette family for
    'ggplot2'.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/catch-26/paradoxR
BugReports: https://github.com/catch-26/paradoxR/issues
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: 
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    grDevices,
    rlang (>= 1.0.0),
    scales (>= 1.3.0)
Suggests: 
    colorspace,
    methods,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
